WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.526
- Just as long as it tastes
like cheese (giggles),

00:00:02.526 --> 00:00:04.763
that's all that I care about.

00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:07.346
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.253 --> 00:00:09.678
- Hello hello hello.

00:00:09.678 --> 00:00:11.466
We are back at it again.

00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:14.379
Another fast-food restaurant
has a new menu item.

00:00:14.379 --> 00:00:15.650
Can you guess what it is?

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.012
Queso dip from Chipotle

00:00:18.012 --> 00:00:19.498
which I'm kind of excited about actually.

00:00:19.498 --> 00:00:22.628
I feel like Chipotle's queso
dip should probably be good.

00:00:22.628 --> 00:00:24.077
I'm very excited to get it.

00:00:24.077 --> 00:00:25.708
I'm gonna try it, I'm gonna
bring it back to the office

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.085
and see how my coworkers like it.

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:29.168
Let's do it. I'm excited.

00:00:38.757 --> 00:00:40.868
- I'm a big Chipotle fan I would say.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.747
- I grew up with Qdoba,
so a little biased.

00:00:43.747 --> 00:00:45.271
- People for birthday's and Christmas

00:00:45.271 --> 00:00:47.312
give me Chipotle gift cards.

00:00:47.312 --> 00:00:49.328
- I don't eat at Chipotle
that much actually.

00:00:49.328 --> 00:00:51.973
- I'm a Chipotle advocate, activist,

00:00:51.973 --> 00:00:54.519
philanthropist, and I
used to work at Chipotle.

00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:55.622
I love Chipotle.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:57.932
- I feel like queso and
chips is like the go-to app

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:59.412
at Mexican restaurants.

00:00:59.412 --> 00:01:00.525
- I'm pretty exited to try it

00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:01.733
because I know some other restaurants

00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:03.570
that have pretty good queso like Moe's

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.991
and other Tex-Mex places.

00:01:05.991 --> 00:01:08.487
- I feel like queso is
more of a you're at home,

00:01:08.487 --> 00:01:10.402
hanging with your friends
and like you have chips

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:12.411
with salsa and also queso.

00:01:12.411 --> 00:01:14.007
- I think as long as it's warm,

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.206
it's good by me.

00:01:15.206 --> 00:01:17.929
- I don't care what it is, I
just wanna try it (chuckles).

00:01:17.929 --> 00:01:19.261
- I just like cheese.

00:01:19.261 --> 00:01:21.388
- It is orange! That's
not what I was expecting.

00:01:21.388 --> 00:01:23.782
- Looks like we have yellow
queso here, not white.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:26.916
- Yeah I see like some little
chili fixin's in there, maybe.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.042
- It smells pretty spicy.

00:01:28.042 --> 00:01:29.534
- Got some spice in the smell.

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:30.591
- I can smell.
- A little bit of colors,

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:32.703
some sazon in there maybe?

00:01:32.703 --> 00:01:34.770
- To me it smells kinda
like enchilada sauce.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.277
- I am scraping off all the chunks

00:01:37.277 --> 00:01:40.790
so I will say that my
review is chunk-less.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.008
- We should just do a little,

00:01:42.008 --> 00:01:43.443
little mix first,
- Ooo see,

00:01:43.443 --> 00:01:45.695
- break up that oil/fat layer.
- interesting consistency.

00:01:45.695 --> 00:01:46.528
- Wow.

00:01:46.528 --> 00:01:50.617
- I'm just gonna get like a big'ol glob.

00:01:50.617 --> 00:01:51.630
- That's spicy.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.924
- There's a lot of flavor.

00:01:52.924 --> 00:01:55.407
There's some citrus, there's some spice.

00:01:55.407 --> 00:01:57.871
- If you get the medium salsa at Chipotle,

00:01:57.871 --> 00:01:59.653
then you can handle
the spice of the queso.

00:01:59.653 --> 00:02:03.534
- It's like the consistency of applesauce.

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:05.641
- That being said, I
am continuing to eat it

00:02:05.641 --> 00:02:06.572
in front of your face.

00:02:06.572 --> 00:02:09.592
- I feel like this also gives
me like classic nacho vibes.

00:02:09.592 --> 00:02:11.631
- Putting it on a
burrito, like this on like

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.840
in like my, my bowl,
- Yeah.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:16.353
- my burrito bowl.
- On your entree is a win,

00:02:16.353 --> 00:02:17.481
definitely.
- Oh absolutely.

00:02:17.481 --> 00:02:19.281
- If I were drunk and go into Chipotle

00:02:19.281 --> 00:02:20.880
and just wanted some cheesy goodness,

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.980
I would still get this.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:24.250
It passes my queso

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.083
bar.

00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:25.916
- Chipotle still rules.

00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:26.749
- Oh yeah.

00:02:26.749 --> 00:02:28.302
We'll finish the chips.

00:02:28.302 --> 00:02:29.870
- Yeah, we'll take the chips.
- For sure.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.092
- Okay so that's the scoop.

00:02:31.092 --> 00:02:32.589
Chipotle now has queso.

00:02:32.589 --> 00:02:34.157
They finally gave the
people what they want.

00:02:34.157 --> 00:02:36.326
Overall, people really liked the queso.

00:02:36.326 --> 00:02:38.166
Some people thought it
was a little too spicy

00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:39.909
or that it had a weird consistency,

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:41.767
but the general consensus was that people

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:44.188
would want to include the queso
in their meal at Chipotle.

00:02:44.188 --> 00:02:45.285
If you've been to New York

00:02:45.285 --> 00:02:47.112
and you've tried the Chipotle queso

00:02:47.112 --> 00:02:49.551
or if you'd like to try
the new Chipotle queso,

00:02:49.551 --> 00:02:50.730
let us know in the comments below

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.074
and that's about it!

00:02:52.074 --> 00:02:53.155
I'll just be sitting here on this couch

00:02:53.155 --> 00:02:54.838
until the next fast-food restaurant

00:02:54.838 --> 00:02:56.838
releases something new.

